---
description: Avoid duplicate controls that perform the same local action
globs:
  - src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# One outcome, one control

Do not render multiple nearby interactive controls that produce the same outcome.

- If a row, card, image, label, or field is already tappable, do not add a separate icon/button that repeats its action.
- Editable inputs do not need an adjacent edit/focus button.
- Keep a second control only for a distinct action. Non-interactive chevrons/status icons are fine.
- Surviving control: one accessibility label + one `ontrack.*` testID.
